{"ref":"BDB, קְעִילָה","hw":"קְעִילָה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְעִילָה</span></big><sub>18</sub>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Κεειλα: in Judah, toward Philistines, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.1\">1 S 23:1</a> + 13 times <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.23\">23</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">קְעִלָה</span>, v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.13\">13</a>); <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:44\" href=\"/Joshua.15.44\">Jos 15:44</a> (P), cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.19\">2 Ch 4:19</a> (geneal. scheme); post-ex. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּלֶךְ קְעִילָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.17\">Ne 3:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.18\">18</a>; mod. <em>Kîlā</em>, c. 8 m. NW. from Hebron, GASm<sup>Geogr. 230</sup> Buhl<sup>Geogr. 193</sup>; cl. TelAm. <em>Ḳilti</em> Wkl<sup> No. 165, 11, 18, etc.</sup>.","next":"BDB, קעקע","prev":"BDB, קֶ֫סֶת"}